WEBVTT

00:00:12.374 --> 00:00:14.627
<v><b>I:</b></v> When was the last time you were at an airport?

00:00:15.246 --> 00:00:16.840
<v><b>S:</b></v> Um, about a month ago.

00:00:17.443 --> 00:00:19.820
<v><b>I:</b></v> Were you going somewhere or meeting someone?

00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:23.667
<v><b>S:</b></v> I was meeting, um, my mother, who was, er,

00:00:24.409 --> 00:00:27.904
she arrived at midnight, coming back from Tenerife.

00:00:33.241 --> 00:00:34.902
<v><b>I:</b></v> Do you have any plans for tonight?

00:00:35.892 --> 00:00:37.678
<v><b>S:</b></v> Er, yes, I do have plans for tonight.

00:00:37.678 --> 00:00:39.460
I’m going to a party with some friends.

00:00:47.100 --> 00:00:49.100
<v><b>I:</b></v> What housework do you hate doing?

00:00:49.414 --> 00:00:54.000
<v><b>C:</b></v> I hate cleaning the bathroom, that’s my least favourite job around the house.

00:00:54.219 --> 00:00:55.980
<v><b>I:</b></v> Is there anything you don’t mind doing?

00:00:57.300 --> 00:01:01.900
<v><b>C:</b></v> I don’t mind cleaning the kitchen, because there’s usually a lot of food to eat.

00:01:08.220 --> 00:01:11.220
<v><b>I:</b></v> Have you ever bought something online and had a problem?

00:01:11.940 --> 00:01:15.940
<v><b>A:</b></v> I, I’ve bought clothes online that didn’t fit, but that’s about it.

00:01:24.420 --> 00:01:25.860
<v><b>I:</b></v> How organized are you?

00:01:26.780 --> 00:01:28.260
<v><b>M:</b></v> Er, not very.

00:01:28.308 --> 00:01:33.260
Um, I tend to be fairly disorganized, but still get things done.

00:01:34.460 --> 00:01:36.500
<v><b>I:</b></v> Have you ever missed a train or a flight?

00:01:37.100 --> 00:01:42.593
<v><b>M:</b></v> Yes, yes. I was flying to Poland and didn’t wake up in the morning,

00:01:42.593 --> 00:01:44.700
and got to the gate as the flight was leaving.